WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In Nancy, a practice counted by hand.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Émile Coué prescribed twenty repetitions, morning and night.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The knots counted words spoken. Not outcomes.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A testimonial records a claim. Comparison tests a cause.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Modern values-affirmation is a different intervention.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The final knot leaves the scientific question open.
